<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM INDIANAPOLIS MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM INDIANAPOLIS MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the $1 million</p>
<p>RCA tennis championships on Wednesday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Josh Eagle (Australia) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat 2-Goran Ivanisevic</p>
<p>(Croatia) 6-7 (5-7) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>3-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Arnaud Boetsch (France) 6-2 6-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 6-2</p>
<p>4-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Raviv Weidenfeld (Israel) 6-3</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>5-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat Steve Campbell (U.S.) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>5-7 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>7-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Martin Damm (Czech</p>
<p>Repubic) 6-7 (6-8) 7-5 7-5</p>
<p>Grant Stafford (South Africa) beat 8-Cedric Pioline (France)</p>
<p>2-6 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>9-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Thierry Champion (France) 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>10-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) beat Eyal Ryan (Israel) 6-2</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat 12-Chris Woodruff (U.S.) 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>14-Andre Agassi (U.S.) beat Olivier Delaitre (France) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 6-1</p>
<p>16-Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat Fabrice Santoro (France) 6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Richard Fromberg (Australia) beat Mark Merklein (U.S.) 6-3</p>
<p>7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Tommy Ho (U.S.) beat Glenn Weiner (U.S.) 3-6 7-6 (7-2) 6-3</p>
